\frac{d}{dk} \left( \frac{2k^2}{k - 1} \right) = \frac{(k - 1) \cdot 4k - 2k^2 \cdot 1}{(k - 1)^2} = \frac{4k^2 - 4k - 2k^2}{(k - 1)^2} = \frac{2k^2 - 4k}{(k - 1)^2} = \frac{2k(k - 2)}{(k - 1)^2}
